config AMLOGIC_S7D_VIDEO_FIRMWARE
	tristate "Amlogic S7D resident video firmware archive"
	depends on ARM64 && OF
	depends on AMLOGIC_AMLTEE && AMLOGIC_OPTEE && !AMLOGIC_MEDIA_ENABLE
	select FW_LOADER
	help
	  Own the immutable video firmware archive uploaded through OP-TEE.
	  Decoder and encoder consumers may reload without uploading it again.
	  A module build remains resident until reboot because the secure archive
	  has no verified unload or state-query API. Forced unload and dynamic
	  removal of this firmware service are not supported.
